{
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "nav",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "# Character｜结构图\nHost／Extension／Health／Base及H1/H2已编码冻结；Hero旧三调用未迁移。\nBuild55已UHT写33文件；Build56整链失败，runtime未链接／未新UE，R0未复测。\n[[Character/结构|结构文档]] · [[GGYGO_流程_角色初始化.canvas|流程图]]",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 1500,
      "height": 130,
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "host",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 外部宿主：AGGYGOCombatantState\nRequestAvatarBinding(原端点,H,Context)\n→Init／Release／Refresh实际步骤历史。\nAttach/Detach/OnRep/EndPlay共用原链。\nH1已提交cleanup／H2未提交Operation已消费冻结。\n已进入UHT／编译；整链失败，未新UE。\n[[Combatants/结构|宿主契约]] · [[Teams/结构]] · [[BossAI/结构]]",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 240,
      "width": 390,
      "height": 245,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "data",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## UGGYGOPawnData\n`PawnClass` / `AbilitySets` / `AbilityGroupConfig` / `TagRelationshipMapping`\n`MovementSet` / `InputConfig` / `DefaultCameraMode`：分发给对应消费者。",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 570,
      "width": 390,
      "height": 215,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "character",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## AGGYGOCharacterBase / HeroCharacter\nPawn承载Extension／Health／CMC；玩家派生另有Hero。\nPostInitializeComponents Super后先装原订阅→RegisterLocalAbilitySystemNoticeAndCall。\n原记录只持三weak身份/token/退休；晚token只还原Extension，不缓存H/ASC/Set/Context/Ready。\nConsumeLocalAbilitySystemNotice：Ready/Refreshed带H/Context、Released只原H→Health三native入口。\nEndPlay/BeginDestroy退原token；真实新BeginPlay可重开。源码冻结，整链构建未通过。\n[[Character/结构#Base原订阅与typed消费（已编码，未编译）|接口与资源机制]]",
      "x": 510,
      "y": 330,
      "width": 430,
      "height": 400,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "extension",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## UGGYGOPawnExtensionComponent\nSetPawnData(Data)→InitState配置协调。\nInitialize／Uninitialize／HandleControllerChanged→原Host请求，不写ActorInfo。\n唯一持本地H；GetGGYGOAbilitySystemComponent仅返回实际Ready的原ASC。\nEndPlay先关新准入，再释放原H；旧缓存已删除。\n源码冻结；已统一UHT／编译，整链未通过。本地API见右侧。",
      "x": 1050,
      "y": 260,
      "width": 430,
      "height": 280,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "health",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## UGGYGOHealthComponent\n`Initialize/Refresh…LocalAbilitySystemResource(Extension,H,Context,Error)`→原资源安装／同H认证刷新。\n`UninitializeFromLocalAbilitySystemResource(H,Error)`→只释放匹配原H，不RequireReady。\n旧BP共用同机制；Getter／死亡仍归本组件。\nBase typed已正式消费；源码冻结，整链编译链接及运行未完成。",
      "x": 1050,
      "y": 580,
      "width": 430,
      "height": 280,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "hero",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## UGGYGOHeroComponent（玩家）\n`InitializePlayerInput()` → 绑定 Native/Ability Action。\n`DetermineCameraMode()` → 默认/能力覆盖仲裁。\n`SetAbilityCameraMode(Class, SpecHandle)` / `Clear...` → 所有权管理。\n旧AbilityInputTagPressed／AbilityInputTagReleased／QueueAbilityInputRetry(Tag,deadline)未迁移；Build56三处编译错误，能力输入链未闭合。",
      "x": 510,
      "y": 800,
      "width": 430,
      "height": 255,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "movement",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## UGGYGOCharacterMovementComponent\n`SetMovementSet(Data)` → 配置步态/曲线。\n`HasMoveInput()` / `GetHorizontalSpeed()` / `IsTurnBackCurveDriven()` → 发布动画语义。\n[[Movement/结构]]",
      "x": 1050,
      "y": 920,
      "width": 430,
      "height": 235,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "pyrios-render",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## UGGYGOCharacterRenderComponent\n`RefreshMaterials()`：显式槽名/材质 → MID 与原覆盖记录。\n`ReleaseMaterials()`：只释放自身覆盖与描边；同 Mesh/槽恢复原 nullable override。\n`UpdateLighting()`：显式灯/弱缓存 → 受限主光；无灯直接光为零。\n`UpdateOutline()`：显式材质 → Leader Pose 壳。\n[[Character/渲染实现|契约与限制]] · [[GGYGO_流程_Pyrios渲染.canvas|流程图]]",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 850,
      "width": 390,
      "height": 350,
      "color": "1"
    },
    {
      "id": "pyrios-materials",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## Pyrios 材质资产\n`M_Pyrois_Toon`（Unlit）+ Body 1 / Body 2 / Weapon 三个 MI → 角色表面。\n`M_Pyrois_Outline` → 运行时反面扩张描边；FX01 槽位绑定 `MI_Pyrois_Body_FX`（父材质 `/Game/Characters/Shared/FX/Materials/M_FX_DissolveMaskLayers`），组件不接管该槽。\n路径：`/Game/Characters/Player/Pyrios/Materials/Generated/`。",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 1235,
      "width": 390,
      "height": 265,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "contract",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 当前链与剩余边界\nHost→ASC事务→Extension Install→Host公布→真实Publish/Dispatching→Ready；原Release不走旧Extension执行器。\nExtension入口／Getter、Health原资源及Base typed消费已接；H1提交cleanup与H2失败Init Operation清理已消费。ASC独占证明/Binding/发布资格。\nHero旧Pressed／Released／Retry未迁移；SetPawnData配置协调保留，能力授予不归Extension。\nBuild55已UHT写33生成文件；Build56三机械错误消除，仍因Hero旧三调用失败，runtime未链接／未新UE。\nR0历史2 Fail／12 errors未复测；源码有限接受不证明整链或资产／网络通过。\n[[Character/结构#ASC 本地资源四阶段接口（L1）|本地API]] · [[Combatants/结构|Host实现与验证边界]]",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 1600,
      "width": 1450,
      "height": 300,
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "pyrios-mesh",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## Pyrois 模型 / BP_PC_Pyrios\n模型三槽已保存 Toon MI，编辑器直接预览表面。\nBP 显式 MaterialSlots / OutlineMaterial 已迁移并冷回读。\n真实 PIE 已验证 MID/描边与主光响应；静态视口仍无运行描边壳。",
      "x": 510,
      "y": 1235,
      "width": 430,
      "height": 265,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "render-compatibility",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 序列化兼容与配置验收\n`UGGYGOPyriosRenderComponent` 继承通用类，保留旧身份。\nBP 显式槽位、描边与调参已保存重开核对；legacy=false。\n真实 PIE：3 表面 MID + Leader Pose 描边；主光限幅/关灯恢复通过。\n两项渲染自动化通过；视觉还原仍有缺口。\n[[Character/渲染实现|证据与边界]]",
      "x": 1580,
      "y": 850,
      "width": 470,
      "height": 350,
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "local-asc-resource",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## Extension 本地 ASC 资源（L1）\n原weak ASC／Pawn＋ASC Binding→opaque H；不签新Binding。\nInstallLocalAbilitySystemResources(ASC,Pawn,Context)→Installed未Ready。\nWithdrawLocalAbilitySystemResources(H)→撤原槽，无原生写入／广播。\nNotifyLocalResourcesReleased(H)→原H义务，Context空，不清后继。\nNotifyLocalResourcesReady(H,Receipt)→ASC真实Dispatching认证Ready／Refresh。\nGetCurrentLocalAbilitySystemResource→原槽快照，不授权。\nIsLocalAbilitySystemResourceInstalled/Ready(H)→分别验装配／可用。\nRegisterLocalAbilitySystemNoticeAndCall / Unregister...(Handle)→精确订阅／回放／移除。\nHost／Extension已调用，Health／Base已消费；Hero待迁移。已进入统一构建，整链未通过；历史L1单叶不覆盖Host/R0。\n[[Character/结构#ASC 本地资源四阶段接口（L1）|完整合同]] · [[AbilitySystem/结构|ASC权威]]",
      "x": 1580,
      "y": 230,
      "width": 470,
      "height": 570,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "host-request-port",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## IGGYGOAvatarBindingHostInterface\nRequestAvatarBinding(Request)→栈上真实Result/Steps。\n原weak Host／ASC／Pawn／Extension＋Context／opaque H；Init空H，Release/Refresh原H与记录Context。\nASC组件GetOwner固定端口，不猜可变ActorInfo Owner。\nH1：CheckAvatarBindingCleanupContext(原提交Context)认证原清理来源；关闭原Host/Owner显式ClearActorInfo，正常PreserveOwner。\nH2：TryCleanupFailedAvatarActorInfoInit(原Operation,纯原scope)清未提交Init残留；Init仍失败，不产生Receipt/Notice/Ready。\n两权限各由ASC认证；Host只记录实际Steps，不持证明或第二Ready。跨Host旧释放→新绑定，失败未绑定不回滚。\nOptional头已修正，Build55实际UHT；Build56完整runtime未链接／未新UE。\n[[Character/结构#Host原生请求接口（已定义，生产迁移中）|接口定义]] · [[AbilitySystem/结构|清理契约]]",
      "x": 1580,
      "y": 1260,
      "width": 470,
      "height": 570,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "health-original-resource-record",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## Health唯一原资源记录｜已编码\ncpp `FAbilitySystemResource`：原Health/Pawn/Extension弱身份、H、ASC/HealthSet弱引用、认证Context、五token、退休标记。\n五lambda只捕原记录；每事件入口复制当时Context。同H Refresh仅更新认证Context，不重绑或重放UI初值。\n`RetireOriginalResource`→先退休/摘自身原槽，再五token精确Remove；失效Set不替换。\nUI／Tag／GameplayEvent／GE外调复核原记录/H/Set/Context；旧安装失败不清同H重建或刷新后的合法后继。\nEndPlay/OnUnregister独立清理，不等待Released；DeathState归Health，数值归HealthSet，不签Binding/Ready。\nBase已正式消费；已进入统一UHT/编译，完整runtime及新UE未通过，旧无H夹具与R0未复测。\n[[Character/结构#Health原资源与五委托（已编码，未编译）|接口与关键实现]]",
      "x": 2170,
      "y": 230,
      "width": 720,
      "height": 650,
      "color": "5"
    }
  ],
